docs {
  # Onboarding (production)

  Getting a participant onto NHCX in production, in four steps on the v2 participant service: create, confirm the creation with the passcode (validate), configure the certificate and endpoint (v2 participant update), and confirm that with its passcode (update validate). The certificate alone can be replaced without a passcode (v2 update cert). The registry id is the HFR id for a hospital or the IRDAI id for a payer.

  The sandbox is the folder before this one, Onboarding (sandbox): one call each way, no passcode.
}
